win11-clipboard-history (2.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Incremental SQLite persistence (upsert / delete / meta updates).
  * Enforce tiling WM config rewrite as an opt-in setting.
  * Pin outbound HTTPS DNS to validated public addresses (SSRF).
  * Cap clipboard history at 2000 items.
  * Run frontend and Rust tests in CI; publish SHA256SUMS on release.

